Apple today updated Final Cut Pro (FCP), adding MotionVFX integration. Apple purchased the company earlier this year, so now the MotionVFX library is part of FCP. It includes the templates, titles, themes, effects, layouts, and transitions that are popular with creators.<br/>
<br/>
